903 citations (Crossref/DOI) [2026-03-12]\\
TLDR: This Review discusses the major advances and the emerging concepts in this field, summarizes what is known about the differentiation and the protective functions of tissue-resident memory T cells in different tissues in the body and highlights key unanswered questions.},
