65 citations (Crossref/DOI) [2026-10-19]},
  file = {C:\Users\10053234\Documents\Thesis_bibliography\Zotero\storage\CBMLUU6K\Muthuswamy et al. - 2021 - CXCR6 by increasing retention of memory CD8+ T cells in the ovarian tumor microenvironment promotes.pdf}
