73 citations (Crossref/DOI) [2026-05-26]\\
70 citations (Crossref/DOI) [2026-04-14]},
  file = {C:\Users\10053234\Documents\Thesis_bibliography\Zotero\storage\E4Z446BB\Park et al. - 2023 - Divergent molecular networks program functionally distinct CD8+ skin-resident memory T cells.pdf}
}

